{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19769","headline":"小隐吟 · 孟郊","name":"小隐吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我饮不在醉，我欢长寂然。\n酌溪四五盏，听弹两三弦。\n链性静栖白，洗情深寄玄。\n号怒路傍子，贪败不贪全。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}